        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>1st question is currently causing a philosophical discussion in the &quot;Can&#39;t deal damage thread&quot;. Personally, I rule that even if you&#39;re immune to the damage, you can still take it. Otherwise, Ra would have to destroy ongouings to deal with a Fire in the Biosphere, which really doesn&#39;t match my conception of how Ra should handle fire.</p><p>2nd, it&#39;s per hero. The &quot;belonging to THAT hero&quot; is the part that specifies that this is a per hero effect, versus Baron Blade&#39;s Devious Disruption which affects everyone.</p>",
